    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve never been particularly drawn to mathematics, even though I studied it in school. My vocational diploma focused more on practical skills, and I found math abstract and disconnected from real life. I enjoy art and literature, where patterns and stories feel more tangible. Still, I respect math as a tool, especially in fields like engineering or design, which I see in my city of Lecce.",
